+})
+
+# Check complexity before reading
+complexity = await client.call_tool('analyze_complexity', {
+    'file_path': 'services/engine.py'
+})
+
+# Set focus mode for ADHD filtering
+await client.call_tool('update_focus_mode', {'mode': 'focused'})
+
+# Always close client
+await client.close()
+
+PERFORMANCE TARGETS:
+- find_symbol: <50ms (LSP), <200ms (grep fallback)
+- goto_definition: <80ms (cached), <100ms (uncached)
+- analyze_complexity: <100ms (Tree-sitter), <20ms (fallback)
+- All tools: Meet ADHD target of <200ms response time
+
+COMPONENT STATUS:
+- LSP: Lazy-loaded on first navigation query
+- Tree-sitter: Lazy-loaded for complexity analysis
+- Database: Phase 3 feature (not required for basic operation)
+- Redis cache: Available for performance optimization
+
+GRACEFUL DEGRADATION:
+- LSP unavailable → Automatic fallback to grep-based search
+- Tree-sitter missing → Basic line counting metrics
+- Database offline → Simplified heuristics (no data loss)
+
+ERROR HANDLING:
+- All tools return structured error responses
+- Never crash on missing components
+- Clear error messages with fallback suggestions
+
+INTEGRATION NOTES:
